{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18761","headline":"和州送钱侍御自宣州幕拜官便於华州觐省 · 刘禹锡","name":"和州送钱侍御自宣州幕拜官便於华州觐省","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五彩绣衣裳，当年正相称。\n春风旧关路，归去真多兴。\n兰陔行可采，莲府犹回瞪。\n杨家绀幰迎，谢守瑶华赠。\n御街草泛灧，台柏烟含凝。\n曾是平生游，无因理归乘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18761.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18761","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}